decisions:
  - id: P8-D83
    decision: G-LOG-04's critical class is measured at human cadence (1 critical/s wall time under the bulk load), the budget stays critical p99 < 25 ms, and the critical-commit durability mechanism (F_FULLFSYNC vs F_BARRIERFSYNC vs plain fsync) is chosen by Aegis from probe evidence
    rationale: Arm G's 1-in-64 rate is far above real decision rates; full flush at that rate cost a 490 ms p99.
